                "RequestForInformationInput/message": "@{concat('Review the Word document [here](', body('agent-9674c9fd-3ad2-4c35-856a-b41009c14ac7')['structuredOutput/draft_file_link'], '). Select Yes to approve this exact document or No to reject it. Rejection ends this workflow without a final file.')}",
